<title>FINLAND: TABLE - UPM H1 PROFIT RISES 70 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - UPM H1 PROFIT RISES 70 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997</p>
<p>					 (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax   3,525 vs 2,076</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  10.20 vs 6.17</p>
<p> Net sales					 26,420 vs 26,172</p>
<p> Operating profit				 4,429 vs 3,189</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish forest industry group UPM-Kymmene Oy's H1 profit before extraordinary items and tax had been 3,380 million markka (range 3,150-3,571 million).  </p>
